 "description": "The EPUB 3 Community Group was a forum for the technical development of EPUB 3 and related extension specifications and ancillary deliverables. That work has been transferred to the  \r\n<a href=\"https://www.w3.org/groups/wg/pm/\">Publishing Maintenance Working Group</a> for standardization (see the <a href=\"https://github.com/w3c/epub-specs/\">GitHub Repository for EPUB 3</a>). For other technical discussions, please join the <a href=\"https://www.w3.org/community/publishingcg/\">Publishing Community Group</a>.\r\n\r\nThe <a rel=\"nofollow\" href=\"http://www.w3.org/2017/02/EPUB3CGcharter\">EPUB 3 Community Group charter</a> contains details about this CG's original scope.",
